WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.830
For about six years, a former
prince ate almost nothing.

2
00:00:04.880 --> 00:00:09.660
Later, he remembered that his spine
stood out like a string of beads.

3
00:00:09.710 --> 00:00:13.060
Then he ate again: a bowl of milk-rice.

4
00:00:13.110 --> 00:00:16.720
His five companions left him,
thinking he had given up.

5
00:00:16.770 --> 00:00:20.210
So why was that bowl of
rice the turning point?

6
00:00:20.260 --> 00:00:22.790
In this mission, you'll follow his search,

7
00:00:22.840 --> 00:00:26.490
from two meditation teachers
to extreme austerity.

8
00:00:26.540 --> 00:00:29.130
Then you'll follow the
night under the Bodhi tree,

9
00:00:29.180 --> 00:00:34.380
Mara's challenge, and about 45
years of teaching that came after.

10
00:00:34.430 --> 00:00:39.000
Your mission: explain why eating that
bowl of rice was the turning point.
